<Base
  title="Affiliate Program — Indiev Video Editors"
  description={'Earn rewards by promoting Indie Video Editors. Join our Affiliate Program today and help spread the word about our innovative video editing solutions'}
  canonical="https://www.indiev.org/affiliate"
>
  <Navbar />
<div class="w-embed w-iframe"><!--  Google Tag Manager (noscript)  -->
<!--  End Google Tag Manager (noscript)  -->
</div><main class="main">
<section class="affiliate_hero">
<div class="main_container">
<h1 class="affiliate_title"><span class="affiliate_title_span">Indie Video Editors <br/>Affiliate Program:</span> <br/>Your Path to Rewarding<br/> Partnerships</h1>
<div class="w-embed">
<style>
@media screen and (min-width: 900px) and (max-width: 991px) {
  .affiliate_image_wrapper{
  width:50%}
}
}
@media screen and (min-width: 1140px) and (max-width: 1279px) {
  .affiliate_image_wrapper{
  width:55%}
}
</style>
</div>
<p class="affiliate_text_hero">Transform your influence into income with our Affiliate<br/> Program, perfectly suited for influencers and publishers.<br/> By promoting our video editing subscriptions - $800, <br/>$1,600, and $3,000 monthly - you not only add value <br/>for your audience but also unlock significant earning <br/>opportunities.</p>
<p class="affiliate_text_mob">Transform your influence into income with our Affiliate Program, perfectly suited for influencers and publishers. By promoting our video editing subscriptions - $800, $1,600, and $3,000 monthly - you not only add value for your audience but also unlock significant earning opportunities.</p>
</div>
<div class="affiliate_image_wrapper"></div>
</section>
<section class="highlights">
<div class="main_container">
<h2 class="highlits_title">Program Highlights</h2>
<ul class="affiliate_list w-list-unstyled" role="list">
<li class="affiliate_item">
<h3 class="affiliate_item_title"> Unlimited Potential</h3>
<p class="affiliate_item_text"> Enjoy a 3% monthly cashback as long as your referral remains a subscriber, up to $90 monthly for our premium plan.</p>
</li>
<li class="affiliate_item">
<h3 class="affiliate_item_title">20% Cashback &amp; Discounts</h3>
<p class="affiliate_item_text">Receive a 20% cashback on the first month's subscription fee of anyone you refer, up to $600 for our highest plan. Your referral also gets a 20% discount, making premium video editing more accessible.</p>
</li>
<li class="affiliate_item">
<h3 class="affiliate_item_title"> Lifetime Earnings</h3>
<p class="affiliate_item_text"> There's no cap on referrals or earnings. The more you share, the more you earn.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
