<section class="affiliate_form">
<div class="main_container">
<h2 class="highlits_title affiliate_form_title">Ready to Elevate Your Earnings?</h2>
<p class="affiliate_form_text">Join our Affiliate Program today and leverage your network <br/>for continuous rewards. It's more than just a partnership—it's a chance to <br/>grow together. Sign up now and make every referral count.</p>
<p class="affiliate_form_text affiliate_text_form_buttom">This final version provides a clear, concise overview of the benefits <br/>and steps to get started, emphasizing the potential for substantial earnings<br/> and ongoing rewards.</p>
<div class="form_title">Join</div>
<div class="affiliate-form w-form" id="Affiliate-Form">
<form class="affiliate_form_send" data-name="Affiliate Form Indiev" data-redirect="/thankyou-affiliate" data-wf-element-id="778502a8-7155-a9ca-0d2a-87cfad19e74c" data-wf-page-id="664e18d179282084e9b8a87c" id="wf-form-Affiliate-Form-Indiev" method="post" name="wf-form-Affiliate-Form-Indiev" redirect="/thankyou-affiliate"><label class="field-label-2" for="name-2">Name*</label><input class="text-field-2 w-input" data-name="name" id="name-2" maxlength="256" name="name" placeholder="" type="text"/><label class="field-label-3" for="email-4">Email Address*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" data-name="email" id="email-4" maxlength="256" name="email" placeholder="" required="" type="email"/><label class="field-label-4" for="phone-2">Phone*</label><input class="text-field-4 w-input" data-name="phone" id="phone-2" maxlength="256" name="phone" placeholder="" required="" type="tel"/><input class="submit-button-2 w-button" data-wait="Please wait..." type="submit" value="Join"/></form>
<div class="w-form-done">
<div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div>
</div>
